msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32201"
msgid "How to get an ElevenLabs API key"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32202"
msgid ""
"1. Create a free account at https://elevenlabs.io.\n"
"   Direct API-key page: https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys\n"
"2. Open Developers → API Keys.\n"
"3. Select Create API Key and name it Kodi Lektor PL.\n"
"4. Grant Text to Speech, Voices Read and User Read permissions.\n"
"5. Optionally set a low credit limit.\n"
"6. Copy the key immediately—it is displayed in full only once—and paste it into the add-on settings.\n"
"\n"
"Text to Speech is enough for narration, but Voices Read is required for the voice list and User Read for the account counter. Never share your key. The API is available on the free plan, but each speech generation uses credits. Every user should use their own key."
msgstr ""

